msgid "ReliefOS 5.3.1"
msgstr "ReliefOS 5.3.1"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid ""
"Fileman 接入 inotify 自动刷新当前目录，合并短时间内的变更并保留仍存在的选中项，尽量保留滚动、键盘焦点和正在编辑的地址；同步已展开的当前目录树，监视不可用时提示并可通过 F5 "
"重新扫描和恢复监听。"
msgstr ""
"Fileman uses inotify to refresh the current directory automatically, coalescing rapid changes and "
"retaining surviving selections while preserving scroll, keyboard focus, and edited addresses where"
" possible. It synchronizes expanded current-directory tree entries, reports unavailable "
"monitoring, and supports F5 rescanning and watch recovery."

msgid ""
"安装器将 BIOS/UEFI 引导方式选择前置到分区规划之前，按选择决定是否创建 BIOS Boot 分区，各组合保留 FAT32 "
"ESP；返回修改选项不立即擦盘，同步调整图形、TTY、挂载切换及分区验证流程。"
msgstr ""
"The installer moves BIOS/UEFI selection before partition planning, creating BIOS Boot only when "
"selected and retaining FAT32 ESP in every combination. Returning to change options does not "
"immediately erase disks. GUI, TTY, mount switching, and partition validation are updated together."

msgid ""
"正常桌面启动使用普通 nice 优先级策略：XDM、Xorg 及其输入线程、IceWM 继承 nice=-10，终端及其编译子进程恢复 "
"nice=0；优先级调整失败时仍继续登录。补充并行编译下的实际交互验证与测量说明。"
msgstr ""
"Normal desktop startup uses ordinary nice priorities: XDM, Xorg and input threads, and IceWM "
"inherit nice=-10; terminals and compiler children reset to nice=0. Login continues if priority "
"changes fail. Added actual interaction validation under parallel compilation and measurement "
"notes."

msgid ""
"交互式 Bash 默认启用 ls、dir、vdir 的自动终端颜色，沿用 GNU dircolors；保留用户已有颜色、分页器与别名配置，尊重 NO_COLOR、TERM=dumb "
"及非交互模式，管道和重定向使用纯文本输出。"
msgstr ""
"Interactive Bash enables automatic terminal colors for ls, dir, and vdir using GNU dircolors. "
"Existing colors, pagers, and aliases remain, respecting NO_COLOR, TERM=dumb, and noninteractive "
"mode. Pipes/redirection use plain text."

msgid "修复 RPR 使用相对内核载荷路径时的发布失败；更新锁定的 libde265 到 1.1.3-r0、cups-libs 到 2.4.19-r1 及对应摘要和来源记录。"
msgstr ""
"Fixed RPR publication with relative kernel-payload paths. Updated pinned libde265 to 1.1.3-r0 and "
"cups-libs to 2.4.19-r1, with matching digests and provenance records."

msgid ""
"增加 xHCI Hub 的 QEMU 系统集成验证，核对实际键鼠输入、存储读写、子树移除和重建、旧描述符错误及控制器模块装卸；完善 Fileman、安装器和 XDM "
"测试，更新系统使用与验证边界文档。"
msgstr ""
"Added xHCI Hub QEMU system-integration validation covering actual keyboard/mouse input, storage "
"I/O, subtree removal/recreation, old-descriptor errors, and controller module load/unload. "
"Improved Fileman, installer, and XDM tests and updated usage/validation-boundary documentation."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking changes"

msgid ""
"**否，未新增既有应用入口或磁盘格式的不兼容变更。** 安装器的引导选择顺序和新盘自动布局会按所选固件方式变化；已有安装通过更新流程保留分区。配套内核的内部模块 ABI "
"更新仍要求整套内核、initramfs、模块及清单匹配，不能混用旧 .ko。"
msgstr ""
"**No new incompatibilities in existing application entry points or disk formats.** Installer boot-"
"selection order and automatic new-disk layouts vary with selected firmware; updates preserve "
"existing partitions. The matching kernel's internal module ABI still requires a complete matching "
"kernel, initramfs, modules, and manifest; old .ko files cannot be mixed in."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and migration notes"

msgid ""
"本次为**正式源码 Release**，只提供标签及 GitHub 自动源码归档，不附预编译 VMDK、ISO、Installer、SDK 或 APK。使用 Git "
"递归初始化标签固定的子模块；GitHub ZIP/TAR.GZ 不展开子模块。"
msgstr ""
"This is a **stable source release**, supplying only tags and GitHub automatic archives, without "
"prebuilt VMDK, ISO, Installer, SDK, or APK. Recursively initialize tag-pinned submodules with Git;"
" GitHub ZIP/TAR.GZ does not expand them."

msgid ""
"更新前备份用户数据和引导配置，在新的 O 目录重建；复用配置时执行 olddefconfig 并核对内核 y/m/n。ReliefOS defconfig 会同时重置对应 ReliefNT "
"配置，普通构建保留已有内核设置。"
msgstr ""
"Back up user data and boot configuration, then rebuild in a new O directory. Run olddefconfig when"
" reusing settings and check kernel y/m/n. ReliefOS defconfig also resets the corresponding "
"ReliefNT configuration; normal builds retain existing settings."

msgid "新安装仍默认选择 BIOS 和 UEFI 两种引导方式，可分别取消；先完成选择再确认分区方案。更新已有安装不按新盘布局重新分区，保持原有 swap 设置。"
msgstr ""
"New installs still select both BIOS and UEFI by default, with independent deselection; finish "
"selection before confirming partitions. Updates do not repartition existing installs according to "
"new-disk layouts and preserve swap settings."

msgid "Fileman 自动监听只覆盖当前目录直接子项，不等同于递归监听或搜索。目录被移动、删除、权限不足或事件溢出后，应以重新扫描的结果为准，必要时使用 F5。"
msgstr ""
"Fileman watches only direct children of the current directory, not recursively or as search. After"
" moves, deletion, insufficient permissions, or event overflow, trust rescan results and use F5 as "
"needed."

msgid "桌面优先级采用普通调度策略，繁忙交互可能让出部分编译吞吐；终端重新打开后使用正常优先级。颜色配置也在新终端生效，可显式使用 --color=never 关闭单次输出。"
msgstr ""
"Desktop priorities use ordinary scheduling; heavy interaction may sacrifice some compilation "
"throughput. Reopened terminals use normal priority. Colors also take effect in new terminals; use "
"--color=never to disable a particular output."

msgid ""
"本次发行检查两仓版本生成、5/3/1 数字宏、VERSION_ID 和严格文档构建，不为本标签重新打包或提供系统镜像。既有单项 QEMU 验证不等于整版复验；**VMware "
"验证未完成**，物理硬件和完整本机自举未完成验收。"
msgstr ""
"Release checks cover version generation in both repositories, 5/3/1 numeric macros, VERSION_ID, "
"and strict documentation builds; system images are not repackaged or supplied for this tag. "
"Existing individual QEMU checks are not full-release retests. **VMware validation is incomplete**;"
" physical hardware and complete native bootstrap have not completed acceptance."

msgid "内核功能范围、模块迁移和已知宿主测试问题以 ReliefNT 5.3.1 的独立发布说明为准；不将内核历史单项通过推导成所有应用或全部系统测试通过。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT 5.3.1's separate release notes define kernel scope, module migration, and known host-test"
" issues. Historical kernel test passes do not establish that all applications or system tests "
"pass."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer notes"

msgid ""
"基础版本为 **5.3.1**，主仓生成数字字段为 **5/3/1**，/etc/os-release 的 VERSION_ID 为 5.3.1；内核版本及模块 ABI 身份由标签固定的 "
"ReliefNT 自行生成。"
msgstr ""
"Base version is **5.3.1**, generated numeric fields **5/3/1**, and /etc/os-release VERSION_ID "
"5.3.1. Tag-pinned ReliefNT generates kernel version/module ABI identity itself."

msgid ""
"内核实现、UAPI 和原生探针归属 ReliefNT；系统应用、打包、RPR 与完整虚拟机编排归属 ReliefOS。使用各目录 Kbuild 与现行 Documentation "
"手册，不恢复已退休桌面或私有图形接口。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT owns kernel implementation, UAPI, and native probes; ReliefOS owns system applications, "
"packaging, RPR, and full-VM orchestration. Use per-directory Kbuild and the current Documentation "
"manual; do not restore retired desktops or private graphics interfaces."

msgid "保留 ABI golden 和音频验证策略；不通过重生成基线、修改 BusyBox 或 musl 来掩盖未解决的内核或测试问题。"
msgstr ""
"Preserve ABI golden data and audio-validation policy. Do not hide unresolved kernel/test issues by"
" regenerating baselines or modifying BusyBox or musl."

msgid ""
"更新范围为 5.3.0 版本提交 **1f5a8756cace6a6b32840c1120e217a151200ddc** 之后至本次版本提交；仅记录主仓最终有效更新，排除内核实现、纯合并和纯 "
"gitlink 更新。下一版以本次版本提交为起点。"
msgstr ""
"The range runs after the 5.3.0 version commit **1f5a8756cace6a6b32840c1120e217a151200ddc** through"
" this version commit, recording only final effective repository changes and excluding kernel "
"implementations, pure merges, and gitlink-only updates. The next range starts at this version "
"commit."
